  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Central African Forest Initiative Implementation SingleDonor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Trust Fund is to assist the development of sound land and forest management policies, programs and projects in African countries as part of their low-emission development strategies. The main focus of this Trust Fund includes supporting African countries to define their REDD+ investment strategies and financing policy development, investment programs and projects related to REDD+ in Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
